    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 2.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe hine ofer ðæt feormige, forgylde hine be his were oþþe he hine be ðam ladige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who harbours him after he has been declared an outlaw, shall pay for him to the amount of his wergeld, or clear himself with an oath of equivalent value.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe hine ofor þæt feormige, forgylde hine be his were oððe hine be ðam geladie.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
